%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Act1_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 53d9c73058c85104485c8bc0ca67d485, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1500504064
    m_Localized: That's the last of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1643110400
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1643110401
    m_Localized: Take
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1643110402
    m_Localized: My friend wrote this. Back when we were still in Yelanka.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499008
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499009
    m_Localized: We were all still together then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499010
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499011
    m_Localized: Now this is the only place we're all together. On the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499012
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499013
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499014
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499015
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499016
    m_Localized: You're back. How was work?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499017
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499018
    m_Localized: Soldiers came by...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499019
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499020
    m_Localized: They inspected the house. I wouldn't let them past the doorstep.
      I told them we have a child, and I don't want them bringing the infection in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499021
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499022
    m_Localized: Yes...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499023
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499024
    m_Localized: They said the records show only you living here. No women or children
      are supposed to be here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499025
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499026
    m_Localized: They gave me some kind of notice. I put it on the table. They said
      we have two days to vacate the house so they can move people in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499027
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499028
    m_Localized: He's awake again. He hasn't been sleeping well lately. After the
      soldiers left, he wouldn't settle for ages. I'll go soothe him. Have a look
      at that paper, and check the stove. I think the fire's almost out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499029
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499030
    m_Localized: Lots of dead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499031
    m_Localized: Same as usual.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499032
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499033
    m_Localized: What for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499034
    m_Localized: They want to move people into the house?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499035
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499036
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499037
    m_Localized: We need to do some...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499038
    m_Localized: '"The fire has grown even dimmer."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499039
    m_Localized: Stove
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499040
    m_Localized: '"The fire burns a little brighter."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499041
    m_Localized: Stove
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499042
    m_Localized: I need to find more firewood before it gets dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499043
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499044
    m_Localized: They should still be handing some out at the hospital, if I can
      get there in time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499045
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499046
    m_Localized: I don't want to tear more of the house apart. There's barely anything
      left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499047
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499048
    m_Localized: Add firewood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499049
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499050
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499051
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499052
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499053
    m_Localized: Notice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499054
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499055
    m_Localized: Read
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499056
    m_Localized: I need to get back before the fire goes out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499057
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499058
    m_Localized: Leave the house
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499059
    m_Localized: I'm so hungry. I hope this isn't the last piece. Payday is still
      a long way off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499060
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499061
    m_Localized: Leave it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499062
    m_Localized: Eat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499063
    m_Localized: It's almost burned out. I need to put something on the fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499064
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499065
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499066
    m_Localized: What are we going to do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499067
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499068
    m_Localized: Maybe we should leave? I heard there are still some trains running.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499069
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499070
    m_Localized: Though the woman next door said the next one won't leave until next
      month because of the cold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499071
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499072
    m_Localized: She also said they aren't taking houses from doctors and officials.
      Apparently they have some kind of document that says no one can be moved in
      with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499073
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499074
    m_Localized: You're going out for firewood, aren't you? I saw a soldier by the
      chapel. Maybe he knows which houses they're taking and which ones they're leaving
      alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499075
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499076
    m_Localized: I... I'm just scared for our son... If they throw us out...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499077
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499078
    m_Localized: I'll think of something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499079
    m_Localized: They won't throw us out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499080
    m_Localized: Maybe...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499081
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499082
    m_Localized: Could we get that document?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651499083
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1668276224
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1668276225
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
